never to be seen again." this lays things
out and sets up a countdown of the days

00:01:08.159 --> 00:01:12.240
until we get to number 10.
it's been a few weeks since the gang

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.080
traveled to Ardham
where uncle George met his demise. back

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:19.040
in Chicago Tic has been staying at his
uncle's house

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:22.720
where it feels like he's worn out his
