00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.640
that white people got magic on their
side?" when Tic mentions he thinks

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:59.119
uncle george might want his family to
know the truth montrose continues,

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:02.640
"Hippolyta can't do shit. we can't do shit."
and

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:07.840
it is where they're at. telling hippolyta
and diana what happened to george might

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:11.599
give them some kind of peace of mind,
but there still wouldn't be anything

00:02:11.599 --> 00:02:15.520
anyone could do about it.
so maybe ignorance about the secret

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:18.640
society
and their lovecraftian monsters is

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:22.800
actually bliss in this case.
Letitia is also dealing with things in

00:02:22.800 --> 00:02:25.920
her own way,
which turns out to be buying a house in

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:29.920
an all-white neighborhood.
pioneering. she also makes a decision to

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.519
keep the truth about what happened in
Ardham from her sister Ruby

00:02:33.519 --> 00:02:37.599
and goes one step further when keeping
the truth about where she got the money

00:02:37.599 --> 00:02:41.040
to buy the house.
instead she convinces Ruby to move in

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:45.440
with her so that they can begin to heal
their relationship, which does seem like

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:49.360
something that she wants to do,
but later in the episodes things will

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:53.280
fall apart when ruby finds out that she
didn't win the money by playing the

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:57.280
numbers.
the house in question turns out to be a

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:01.519
handful in a couple of different ways.
first the fact that it's haunted

00:03:01.519 --> 00:03:05.200
probably played a big part in how Leti
was able to afford it

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:08.239
and establishing a boarding house for
black people

00:03:08.239 --> 00:03:12.000
in an all-white neighborhood in 1950s
chicago

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.519
isn't something the neighbors are ready
to let go unnoticed.

00:03:15.519 --> 00:03:18.800
these are the two things Leti is up
against and to be clear

00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:23.599
this is a Leti episode and both of
these things come at her at the same

00:03:23.599 --> 00:03:26.000
time.
on the haunted house side things

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:29.760
escalate quickly. while in bed something
that Leti can't see

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.920
is pulling at her sheets. she finds
herself sweating when she wakes up and

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:37.840
that leads her to check the boiler in
the basement where she hears what sounds

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:41.280
like someone trying to escape from yet
another room below.

00:03:41.280 --> 00:03:44.799
as the idea that her new house is
haunted is dawning on her

00:03:44.799 --> 00:03:48.239
she's also putting up with the fact that
the white neighbors are trying to

00:03:48.239 --> 00:03:50.640
intimidate her.
everything comes to a head at a

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:54.799
housewarming party where someone decides
to burn a cross on the front lawn

00:03:54.799 --> 00:03:58.400
to let Leti and her housemates know how
they really feel.

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:01.599
it's enough to get Leti out there
showing how she really feels.

00:04:01.599 --> 00:04:05.040
she grabs a bat. unleashes on the cars
parked out front,

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:08.879
silencing the blowing horns that
neighbors have been using to terrorize

00:04:08.879 --> 00:04:12.959
them since they first moved in.
it's the first of two scenes where we

00:04:12.959 --> 00:04:16.079
see letitia fucking lewis in all her
glory

00:04:16.079 --> 00:04:20.639
and i've gotta mention that Jurnee
Smollet really rises to the occasion here.

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:24.320
it's a great scene and it is put
together really well.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:27.919
of course leti doesn't live in the
world where if someone comes to your

00:04:27.919 --> 00:04:30.479
house
and burns a cross out front you'd be

00:04:30.479 --> 00:04:33.440
forgiven for losing your temper. when the
police arrive

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:37.759
