00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:44.880
helping of intimidation.
on top of clearly enjoying the power he

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.919
has over leti
the officer has some questions about the

00:04:47.919 --> 00:04:51.759
house he asked her if anything weird has
been going on inside

00:04:51.759 --> 00:04:55.360
and if someone told her to buy the
winthrop house in the first place

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:59.360
he can sense that she doesn't know what
he's talking about so he tells her that

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:03.039
the police found the parts of eight dead
black people in the basement

00:05:03.039 --> 00:05:08.160
using the n-word to drive home the idea
that he won't lose any sleep if the same

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.960
thing
happened to the current occupants. the

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:13.600
next day
she meets the ghost of the previous

00:05:13.600 --> 00:05:17.440
