00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:24.000
this leads her to investigate where she
learns that the head belongs to a fired

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:29.199
university professor named hiram epstein.
he was the last person who lived there

00:05:29.199 --> 00:05:33.680
he had a connection to the police
officer who was asking her questions

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:38.000
and this probably involved human test
