00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.360
he tells her it's time to move out but
she isn't convinced

00:05:57.360 --> 00:06:00.800
she says, "i thought the world was one way
and i found out it

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:04.080
isn't it terrifies me but i can't live
in fear

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:08.240
i won't i gotta face this world head on
